{"case_id": "sizing_pullup_i2c_200ua", "description": "I2C-grade pull-up keeping the line above 2.36 V with 200 uA pull current on 3.3 V", "function": "pull_up_resistor", "inputs": {"pull_current_ua": 200, "v_high_min": 2.36, "v_supply": 3.3}, "expected": [4700.0], "why": "R=(V_supply-V_high_min)/I_pull=(3.3-2.36)/200e-6=4700 -> E12 step 4.7k (reference case of sizing.pull_up_resistor)"}
