{"case_id": "sizing_divider_3v3_halves", "description": "Voltage divider that halves 3.3 V with two equal 10k resistors", "function": "voltage_divider", "inputs": {"v_in": 3.3, "r_top": 10000, "r_bottom": 10000}, "expected": [1.65, 0.5], "why": "ratio=R_bottom/(R_top+R_bottom)=10000/20000=0.5; V_out=V_in*ratio=3.3*0.5=1.65 V"}
